# What `vercel deploy` from this folder must never upload: private notes, local QA output,
# secrets, and files the build machine fetches or regenerates itself (the Zodiak font is
# downloaded by scripts/fetch-fonts.mjs on every build, as its licence prefers).
# Deployments made from the Git repository build only the committed files.
.env*
!.env.example
.vercel
PITCH_NOTES.md
brand/qa
qa-output
test-results
playwright-report
.lighthouse
node_modules
.next
src/fonts/vendor
images/*.png
images/*.jpg
images/*.jpeg
images/*.PNG
images/*.JPG
images/*.JPEG
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
